  "body": "## Release Notes\n\n### Fixed\n\n- *(logs)* measure scroll bottom in wrapped rows ([#746](https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/pull/746))\n\n### Other\n\n- *(deps)* bump serde_json from 1.0.151 to 1.0.154 ([#744](https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/pull/744))\n- *(deps)* bump tokio from 1.53.2 to 1.53.3 ([#743](https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/pull/743))\n- *(deps)* bump toml from 1.1.7+spec-1.1.0 to 1.1.8+spec-1.1.0\n\n## Install flowrs-tui 0.16.1\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via shell script\n\n```sh\ncurl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/releases/download/flowrs-tui-v0.16.1/flowrs-tui-installer.sh | sh\n```\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via Homebrew\n\n```sh\nbrew install jvanbuel/flowrs/flowrs\n```\n\n## Download flowrs-tui 0.16.1\n\n|  File  | Platform | Checksum |\n|--------|----------|----------|\n| [flowrs-tui-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/releases/download/flowrs-tui-v0.16.1/flowrs-tui-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Apple Silicon macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/releases/download/flowrs-tui-v0.16.1/flowrs-tui-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [flowrs-tui-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/releases/download/flowrs-tui-v0.16.1/flowrs-tui-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Intel macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/releases/download/flowrs-tui-v0.16.1/flowrs-tui-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [flowrs-tui-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/releases/download/flowrs-tui-v0.16.1/flowrs-tui-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | x64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/releases/download/flowrs-tui-v0.16.1/flowrs-tui-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n\n\n"
